                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ9YBU_wqpQjQR2mdxvvdOhTo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WUFNtTm5hV3hvWm5sT1RYbEhWbU51YzE4M0xXYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "6 months ago",
                        "rating":  3,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Just not good value.  Cost was about 150% of what the meal would cost in the States.  My latte was luke warm and so was most of the food.  You use an app to order.  As a result, an extra egg that I ordered came out way before the rest of my meal.  Also, there was some mix up where the main meal did not get prepared.  My buddy was almost finished by the time I received my food.  They responded quickly once I asked about it.  Honestly, I would rather have waitstaff dedicated to my table.  Maybe if there was some way to make inquiries or to add comments about the order in the app, then some of this could be avoided.  There were some highlights.  Absolutely loved the salad dressing and the yogurt was quite nice.  I know that Starbucks microwave their food and I never thought I would say this, but for my money it represents better value than this.  The food flavors here are quite nice, but I want hot food and hot coffee.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
